The demo AI's `demoLA` of **0.12** is extremely short-sighted. The AI computes a target point only 12% of the full loop ahead, then steers toward it. With the track being a figure-8 shape with sharp transitions, this tiny look-ahead causes the kart to overshoot or misalign early in the lap, veer off-track, and then get stuck.

