Off-track, speed decays by 6% per frame and is capped at 35% of max speed (≈1 unit/s). Once the kart hits grass with speed 0, it stays at 0 — the off-road friction prevents any recovery. The demo AI never generates steering input that gets the kart back on the asphalt.

